From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lucas De Marchi <ldemarchi@nvidia.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 17:13:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] NVIDIA: SAUCE: cxl: Fix enum forward declaration

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2169549

This enum can't be forward declared and the build with
aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc 16.1 just fails:

    In file included from ../drivers/pci/probe.c:27:
    ../include/cxl/cxl.h:444:62: error: parameter 2 ('type') has incomplete type
    444 | cxl_find_regblock(struct pci_dev *pdev, enum cxl_regloc_type type,
        |                                         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~
    ../include/cxl/cxl.h:444:1: error: function declaration isn't a prototype [-Werror=strict-prototypes]
    444 | cxl_find_regblock(struct pci_dev *pdev, enum cxl_regloc_type type,
        | ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    cc1: some warnings being treated as errors

Replace the forward declaration with the header include.

Cc: Manish Honap <mhonap@nvidia.com>
Fixes: c2905ebe1a66 ("NVIDIA: VR: SAUCE: cxl: Declare cxl_probe_component_regs in public header")
Signed-off-by: Lucas De Marchi <ldemarchi@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Nirmoy Das <nirmoyd@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Matthew R. Ochs <mochs@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Brad Figg <bfigg@nvidia.com>

Conflicts:
	include/cxl/cxl.h: the patch removes the forward declaration of
	  enum cxl_regloc_type. Its context has
	  cxl_region_contains_soft_reserve(), which the base supersedes
	  with the upstream cxl_region_contains_resource(); that block is
	  not added

Ledger-Change: C-02215
Ledger-Origin: nvidia-bos@13fcc3e86fcaaa5fb3fd3dc0213e3a77530d2ab7
---
 include/cxl/cxl.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/include/cxl/cxl.h b/include/cxl/cxl.h
index 3447729ea66c..937d2cd92d10 100644
--- a/include/cxl/cxl.h
+++ b/include/cxl/cxl.h
@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@
 #include <linux/range.h>
 #include <linux/errno.h>
 #include <cxl/mailbox.h>
+#include <cxl/pci.h>
 #include <uapi/cxl/cxl_regs.h>
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_CXL_REGION
@@ -421,7 +422,6 @@ struct cxl_region *cxl_create_region(struct cxl_root_decoder *cxlrd,
 				     int ways);
 int cxl_memdev_attach_region(struct cxl_memdev *cxlmd, struct cxl_attach_region *attach);
 
-enum cxl_regloc_type;
 
 #if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_CXL_BUS)
 
